  "description": "Dead-URL → new-URL redirects for Umbraco 17 & 18. Provides a SQL-backed Redirects table, a Settings-section dashboard for editors to manage 301 rules, and an IContentFinder that resolves redirects at request time. A single flat list of redirects: exact case-insensitive matching with query-string preservation, draft rows, and idempotent migrations.",
